### Get all patients
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients


### Create patient
POST http://localhost:8080/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "P001",
  "name": "Arun Kumar",
  "age": 30,
  "gender": "Male",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "email": "arun@gmail.com",
  "address": "Chennai"
}


### Get patient by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/P001